# Throwaway profiling/measurement harnesses run from the plugin ROOT.
# Committed by accident TWICE on 2026-07-27 (prof3/prof4, then p12) from one
# cause: a broad `git add -A` after a measurement run. A resolution that
# depends on remembering fails a third time, so this is the mechanical fix.
# Anchored with a leading slash so it can only ever match the plugin root -
# real source lives in mcp/ and tests/ and is unaffected.
/prof*.ts
/p[0-9]*.ts
